Software.app catalog icons
==========================

Each icon in this folder is the app icon of the project named
below, taken from that project's repository on GitHub. Icons
larger than 128 pixels were scaled down to 128; an .icns was
converted to PNG. Each belongs to its project. License is
what the LICENSE or COPYING file in the app's folder, or at
the top of its repository, says. Software's own license
(LICENSE at the top of this repository) covers Software's
code, not these.

Made by catalog/fetch-icons.py.

